-        <anchor xml:id=3D"c10e4d7"/>
-      </title>
-      <interlinear-gloss>
-        <jbo>le nanmu puzu vu batci le gerku</jbo>
-        <gloss>The man [past] [long time] [long space] bites the dog.</glo=
ss>
